{"id":"2dcbc44e810f22bc","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-forcing-strong-master-condition.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Strong Master Condition","display":"df-zfc-forcing-strong-master-condition — ZFC Forcing Strong Master Condition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-strong-master-condition","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-strong-master-condition"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-strong-master-condition — ZFC Forcing Strong Master Condition","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-poset]]","[[58-df-zfc-logic-elementary-submodel]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-strong-master-condition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-strong-master-condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-strong-master-condition — ZFC Forcing Strong Master Condition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8cddb830164d6d0b\" href=\"?note=8cddb830164d6d0b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-logic-elementary-submodel\">58-df-zfc-logic-elementary-submodel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak H,L,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\">\\(p,\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak H,L,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\)</span> (condition, model code, ambient-structure code, language, and poset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingStrongMasterCondition}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingStrongMasterCondition}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogicElementarySubmodel}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak H,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogicElementarySubmodel}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak H,L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8cddb830164d6d0b\" href=\"?note=8cddb830164d6d0b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-logic-elementary-submodel\">58-df-zfc-logic-elementary-submodel</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}strong\\text{-}master\\text{-}condition} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingStrongMasterCondition}_S(p,\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak H,L,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogicElementarySubmodel}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak H,L)\\land\\mathbb P\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)\\land\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land p\\in\\mathbb P\\land\n\\forall D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)\\cap\\mathbb P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\n\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)\\cap\\mathbb P\\;\\exists d\\in D\\;(d\\leq_{\\mathbb P}s)\\bigr]\\to\n\\forall q\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\bigl(q\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\to\n\\exists d\\in D\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;\n(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q\\land r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}d)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}strong\\text{-}master\\text{-}condition} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingStrongMasterCondition}_S(p,\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak H,L,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogicElementarySubmodel}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak H,L)\\land\\mathbb P\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)\\land\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land p\\in\\mathbb P\\land\n\\forall D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)\\cap\\mathbb P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\n\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)\\cap\\mathbb P\\;\\exists d\\in D\\;(d\\leq_{\\mathbb P}s)\\bigr]\\to\n\\forall q\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\bigl(q\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\to\n\\exists d\\in D\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;\n(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q\\land r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}d)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The countable model and ambient <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\theta\">\\(H_\\theta\\)</span> are explicit structure codes; forcing membership uses the selected submodel universe.</li>\n<li>Strong <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span>-genericity quantifies every dense subset of the suborder <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)\\cap\\mathbb P\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)\\cap\\mathbb P\\)</span>, not only those dense sets that also happen to be elements of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)\\)</span>; each such set is required to be predense below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis",